.SH NAME
report_table \- Get the per gene fitting quality table of the trained model.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIreport_table(\fBtree\fR as <generic> XGBoostGRN, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the per gene fitting quality table of the trained model.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBtree\fB \fR\- the trained [XGBoostGRN](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.XGBoostGRN) model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a dataframe whose rows are the modelled genes and whose columns are \fBkind\fR,
 \fBn_regulators\fR, \fBn_train\fR, \fBn_validate\fR, \fBr2\fR, \fBrmse\fR,
 \fBbaseline_rmse\fR, \fBimprovement\fR, \fBtrees\fR, \fBmin_value\fR and \fBmax_value\fR.
.PP
